# Figure 2.8 — ELECTORAL VOLATILITY ONLY (four panels). The old Panel 4 (composite
# turbulence PC1) is REMOVED — it was not electoral volatility. New Panel 4 = a
# Chow / sup-F structural-break test run on the electoral-volatility latent itself.
#   1 Net aggregate (GE Pedersen + poll volatility, reliability-weighted MARSS)   -> 2026
#   2 Individual vote-switching (BES recall, Wilson CI)                            -> 2024 (last GE)
#   3 Combined individual-anchored latent                                          -> 2026
